{"seq":3,"slug":"warning-signal-anomaly-detection","title":"下架前预警信号与异常检测：从指标越线到行为突变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/violation-takedown-monitoring/warning-signal-anomaly-detection","wordCount":3047,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"下架前预警信号与异常检测-从指标越线到行为突变\">下架前预警信号与异常检测：从指标越线到行为突变</h1><p>账户被封很少是某一个清晨的突发事件。真正封店的那条指令之前，几乎总有一串更早、更弱、更容易被忽略的信号先到达：绩效指标连续多日贴着阈值爬升、某几个 ASIN 的曝光突然归零、退款率在某个物流渠道上异常抬升、评论增速超过订单增速数倍。平台侧看到的是这些信号的<strong>联合分布</strong>，卖家侧看到的往往只有最后一封「账户已停用」的通知。下架前预警系统的工程目标，就是把这串弱信号在封店动作发生<strong>之前</strong>翻译成可执行告警——它本质是一个<strong>时序异常检测 + 多信号融合 + 告警编排</strong>的问题，而不是一个阈值查表问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层解耦的检测管道\">核心概念：三层解耦的检测管道</h2><p>一个可用的下架前预警系统由三段解耦的职责构成：<strong>信号采集与归一化</strong>（把异质指标转成可比较的异常分数）→ <strong>检测与评分</strong>（判定「是否异常」并量化严重度）→ <strong>告警编排</strong>（决定「通知谁、多快、做什么」）。采集层只忠实还原平台口径，不掺杂判断；检测层只产出分数与理由，不决定响应级别；编排层只消费分数，不重算异常。下面依次拆开四类信号来源、静态阈值为何失效、以及多信号如何融合成可执行的分级告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预警信号的四层来源\">预警信号的四层来源</h2><p>平台的预警信号不是一个列表，而是分层的。把四层混为一谈会导致告警口径混乱：指标层的轻微扰动被当成政策违规报警，会让团队对真正的封店前兆脱敏。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;L1 绩效指标层&lt;br/&gt;ODR / VTR / LSR / 取消率&lt;br/&gt;滚动窗口比率&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;信号归一化&lt;br/&gt;z-score / 变化率 / 持续天数&quot;]&#10;  B[&quot;L2 政策处置层&lt;br/&gt;政策警告 / ASIN 下架 / 账户健康评级扣分&lt;br/&gt;平台的显式通知&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;  C[&quot;L3 行为异常层&lt;br/&gt;曝光骤降 / 退款突变 / 追踪异常 / 评论增速&lt;br/&gt;未被平台通知的自发行为&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;  D[&quot;L4 外部与关联层&lt;br/&gt;账户关联信号 / 法域合规 / 承运商黑名单&lt;br/&gt;GDPR / GPSR / DSA&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;多信号融合评分&lt;br/&gt;严重度 x 置信度 x 时效&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G{&quot;越过告警门槛?&quot;}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[&quot;分级告警 + 处置编排&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[&quot;持续监控 / 抽样复核&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; J[&quot;证据快照留存&lt;br/&gt;供申诉复用&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"L1 绩效指标层&lt;br/&gt;ODR / VTR / LSR / 取消率&lt;br/&gt;滚动窗口比率\"] --&gt; E[\"信号归一化&lt;br/&gt;z-score / 变化率 / 持续天数\"]\n  B[\"L2 政策处置层&lt;br/&gt;政策警告 / ASIN 下架 / 账户健康评级扣分&lt;br/&gt;平台的显式通知\"] --&gt; E\n  C[\"L3 行为异常层&lt;br/&gt;曝光骤降 / 退款突变 / 追踪异常 / 评论增速&lt;br/&gt;未被平台通知的自发行为\"] --&gt; E\n  D[\"L4 外部与关联层&lt;br/&gt;账户关联信号 / 法域合规 / 承运商黑名单&lt;br/&gt;GDPR / GPSR / DSA\"] --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"多信号融合评分&lt;br/&gt;严重度 x 置信度 x 时效\"]\n  F --&gt; G{\"越过告警门槛?\"}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[\"分级告警 + 处置编排\"]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[\"持续监控 / 抽样复核\"]\n  H --&gt; J[\"证据快照留存&lt;br/&gt;供申诉复用\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>典型信号</th>\n<th>可观测性</th>\n<th>相对封店的提前量</th>\n<th>权威来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 绩效指标</td>\n<td>ODR 60 天滚动逼近 1%、VTR 跌破 95%、LSR 升破 4%</td>\n<td>卖家后台自算可复现</td>\n<td>数天到数周</td>\n<td>Amazon Seller Central《Order Defect Rate》《Valid Tracking Rate》</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 政策处置</td>\n<td>Policy Warning、Listing 被移除、账户健康评级扣分</td>\n<td>平台主动通知，几乎无延迟</td>\n<td>小时到数天</td>\n<td>Amazon《Account Health Rating》（0–1000 分档：Healthy / At Risk / Unhealthy）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 行为异常</td>\n<td>单 ASIN 曝光断崖、退款率突变、评论/订单比异常</td>\n<td>需自建管道，平台不通知</td>\n<td>数小时到数天</td>\n<td>Walmart Seller Performance Standards、eBay Seller Level 指标页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 外部关联</td>\n<td>承运商黑名单、GPSR 欧盟责任人缺失、DSA 透明度义务</td>\n<td>需法务/合规侧埋点</td>\n<td>天到月</td>\n<td>EU GPSR（2024-12-13 适用）、EU DSA 第 17/20/23 条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L3 是最有价值也最容易被忽略的一层。平台不会在「你某个 ASIN 曝光昨天掉了 80%」时发通知，但那往往意味着它已进入降权或静默下架的评估队列。<strong>能自己观测到 L3，就等于把预警提前量从平台的「通知时刻」拉回到「平台内部开始评估的时刻」</strong>。这正是自建异常检测系统的回报：指标层的口径复算见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../account-health-metric-model/odr-vtr-metric-definition-window\">ODR/VTR 指标定义与统计窗口</a>，而行为层的异常识别没有任何平台会替你完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"静态阈值为什么必然失效\">静态阈值为什么必然失效</h2><p>最朴素的预警是给每个指标配固定阈值：ODR &gt; 0.8% 报警。它在两类情况下系统性失效。第一，<strong>业务基线本身在漂移</strong>：旺季单量翻十倍，绝对缺陷数上升但比率可能反降；换一条物流渠道，追踪有效率均值整体平移 2 个百分点。固定阈值要么旺季疯狂误报，要么淡季完全不响。第二，<strong>指标分布重尾非高斯</strong>：退款率、评论增速在正常态极度集中在 0 附近，偶发几个离群点就能把均值和标准差算飞，让 z-score 失去意义。</p>\n<p>工程上的标准解法是把「绝对阈值」换成「相对自身历史的稳健基线」。用中位数绝对偏差（Median Absolute Deviation, MAD）代替标准差，用残差代替原值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>MAD</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">median</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">median</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.6745</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">median</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mtext>MAD</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MAD}_t = \\operatorname{median}\\left(\\left|\\, x_i - \\operatorname{median}(x_{[t-w,\\,t]}) \\,\\right|\\right),\\qquad z^{robust}_t = \\frac{0.6745\\,(x_t - \\operatorname{median}(x_{[t-w,\\,t]}))}{\\text{MAD}_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2543em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">median</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3312em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4952em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.6745</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 14–28 天，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6745</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6745</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6745</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^{robust}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在正态假设下与标准 z-score 同尺度。相比标准差，MAD 的<strong>崩溃点（breakdown point）为 50%</strong>——一半数据被离群点污染前，基线依然稳健，这对重尾的电商指标是刚需。</p>\n<p>但单点 z-score 仍会漏掉<strong>渐进式恶化</strong>：指标每天只涨一点点，任何一天都不算离群，累积起来却已从 0.5% 爬到 0.95%。针对这种缓慢漂移，用累计和（CUSUM）或 EWMA 控制图更合适：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_t = \\max\\left(0,\\; S_{t-1} + (x_t - \\mu_0) - k\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_t &gt; h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 时触发告警。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是松弛量（容忍的正常波动，常取基线偏移量的一半），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是决策边界。CUSUM 的核心价值在于<strong>对小幅持续偏移的检测延迟显著低于单点阈值</strong>——这正是「贴着阈值爬升」这类封店前兆的形态。三类方法对比如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>最擅长捕捉</th>\n<th>失效场景</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定阈值</td>\n<td>法规/平台硬红线（如 ODR ≥ 1%）</td>\n<td>季节性、渠道切换导致的基线漂移</td>\n<td>阈值来自平台政策文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳健 z-score（MAD）</td>\n<td>单点尖峰、突发离群</td>\n<td>缓慢渐进漂移</td>\n<td>窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>、阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CUSUM / EWMA</td>\n<td>小幅持续偏移、趋势性恶化</td>\n<td>需要先估基线均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>松弛量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>、边界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>孤立森林 / 多变量检测</td>\n<td>多指标联合异常（比率正常但组合异常）</td>\n<td>可解释性差，申诉时讲不清</td>\n<td>树数、污染率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四类要特别谨慎：多变量模型能发现「单看每个指标都正常、联合起来诡异」的情形（例如曝光没降但转化率、退款率、评论增速同时异动），但它天然不可解释。在申诉场景下，一个讲不出理由的告警等于没有告警——<strong>监管与平台申诉都要求你陈述具体依据</strong>（EU DSA 第 17 条要求平台给出「理由说明书」，卖家的反诉自然也需要对应的事实陈述）。因此工程上多变量模型的输出应当只作为<strong>分流信号</strong>（决定是否升级到人工复核），而最终告警必须回落到可解释的规则或显著性检验上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多信号融合与告警分级\">多信号融合与告警分级</h2><p>单信号告警有个结构性缺陷：<strong>基础比率极低的事件，任何单点检测器的精确率都很差</strong>。假设真正会演变成封店的「问题日」占比只有 0.5%，一个召回率 90%、误报率 5% 的检测器，每天产出的告警里绝大多数都是假的——这就是基础比率谬误。破解方法不是追求单个检测器完美，而是<strong>要求多个相互独立（或弱相关）的信号同时或短窗口内相邻触发</strong>，再放行告警。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>signal</mtext><mi>s</mi></msub><mtext> 在 </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> 内触发</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = \\sum_{s \\in S} w_s \\cdot \\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[\\, \\text{signal}_s \\text{ 在 } \\Delta t \\text{ 内触发} \\,\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">signal</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内触发</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span></span></span></span></span> 越过分级门槛才升级告警级别。分级不是装饰，它直接决定谁来响应、响应多快：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>触发条件（示例）</th>\n<th>目标响应时间</th>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P0 紧急</td>\n<td>L2 收到账户级停用/预留通知，或 L1 指标已越线且 L3 出现曝光断崖</td>\n<td>1 小时内</td>\n<td>冻结广告预算、隔离问题 ASIN、启动申诉证据包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P1 高</td>\n<td>两条以上 L1 指标同时逼近阈值，或单条指标持续越限 ≥3 天</td>\n<td>当日</td>\n<td>复核近 60 天缺陷订单、暂停问题物流渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2 中</td>\n<td>单条 L3 行为异常（退款率突变、追踪异常率抬升）</td>\n<td>24–48 小时</td>\n<td>抽样核查、定位到具体订单/渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3 低</td>\n<td>轻微漂移、趋势性迹象，未越限</td>\n<td>周内</td>\n<td>观察队列，不打扰</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四级门控的工程含义是：<strong>告警分级把「检测」和「响应」解耦</strong>。检测器可相对宽松（宁可多产候选信号），分级逻辑负责把噪声挡在 P0/P1 之外。这也是抑制告警疲劳的关键——如果所有异常都按最高级别推送，团队会在两周内学会无视它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"误报抑制与告警编排\">误报抑制与告警编排</h2><p>分级之后仍有大量重复与自相关噪声需要压制，否则一个持续两天的异常会产生几十条告警。四种标准手段：<strong>去重聚合</strong>（同一 ASIN/渠道在抑制窗口内的同类告警合并为一条，附出现次数与首末时间）；<strong>依赖抑制</strong>（父级信号已触发时抑制其下子级——账户级 P0 触发后，其下所有 ASIN 的 P2 大概率同根因）；<strong>季节性豁免</strong>（大促与平台自身故障日临时放宽阈值，不把平台侧抖动记成卖家风险）；<strong>冷却期</strong>（同一告警确认或关闭前不重复推送，仅在状态升级时重新触发）。</p>\n<p>编排上还有一条易被忽视的约束：<strong>告警必须留下可复用的证据快照</strong>。当停用通知真的到来时，卖家要在有限窗口内提交申诉，说服力取决于能否拿出「问题订单明细、缺陷归因、已采取的纠正措施、指标恢复曲线」。若预警系统在触发时就快照留存当时的指标值、触发信号、原始订单样本与检测器版本，申诉阶段就是「读取快照」而非「重新捞数」。这与同 hub 的 <a href=\"violation-taxonomy-policy-engine\">违规分类法与政策规则引擎</a> 里「判定快照供复议引用」是同一原则：<strong>可解释性与可审计性必须在检测发生的当下捕获，事后无法重建</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从预警到处置的闭环\">从预警到处置的闭环</h2><p>预警系统的价值不在「报警」而在「改变结果」。一个完整的闭环至少有四个反馈回路，缺任何一个都会让系统随时间退化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>检测器 → 申诉</strong>：告警触发的证据快照直接喂给申诉流程。</li>\n<li><strong>申诉结果 → 检测器</strong>：被推翻的是假阳性标签、被维持的是真阳性，这是唯一可信的标注来源；没有它阈值只能靠拍脑袋维护。</li>\n<li><strong>指标恢复 → 处置强度</strong>：指标回到健康区间后自动降级告警、解除临时冻结，避免封店前过度防御本身造成的销售损失。</li>\n<li><strong>规则版本 → 审计</strong>：阈值调整与检测器升级都版本化留痕，因为告警影响的可能是资金预留、广告关停等真实资金动作。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>把四层信号、稳健基线、多信号融合、分级编排串起来，得到的就是一条<strong>在平台动作之前触发、在申诉之时可用、在恢复之后自愈</strong>的预警管道。它的工程难点从来不在算法本身——MAD、CUSUM、孤立森林都是成熟工具——而在于<strong>口径要对齐平台、证据要当下留、告警要分级到人</strong>。这三件事做对了，下架就从一个无法预料的突发事故，变成一个有时间窗、有应对预案、有证据支撑的可管理事件。预警的最终验收标准不是「告警准不准」，而是「封店前是否留出了可行动的窗口，封店后是否拿得出可申诉的证据」。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>说明：本文平台政策数值（ODR 1%、VTR 95%、账户健康评级分档等）以各平台卖家帮助中心当期公告为准，平台会随政策迭代调整口径。写本文时本会话检索配额已用尽，事实依据平台公开帮助文档既有口径与 EU GPSR（适用日 2024-12-13）、DSA 条款编号，落地前请复算对齐当期公示值。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"下架前预警信号与异常检测：从指标越线到行为突变","id":"下架前预警信号与异常检测-从指标越线到行为突变"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层解耦的检测管道","id":"核心概念-三层解耦的检测管道"},{"level":2,"text":"预警信号的四层来源","id":"预警信号的四层来源"},{"level":2,"text":"静态阈值为什么必然失效","id":"静态阈值为什么必然失效"},{"level":2,"text":"多信号融合与告警分级","id":"多信号融合与告警分级"},{"level":2,"text":"误报抑制与告警编排","id":"误报抑制与告警编排"},{"level":2,"text":"从预警到处置的闭环","id":"从预警到处置的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"下架、listing 冻结与账户暂停的执行传播机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/violation-takedown-monitoring/takedown-suspension-enforcement"},"next":{"title":"申诉类型、行动计划（POA）与举证要件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/appeal-reinstatement-workflow/appeal-types-poa-evidence"}}